WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.700
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.802
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:03.836
We hope you're all
doing well tonight.

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:05.604
Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.604 --> 00:00:06.939
President Biden said today

00:00:06.939 --> 00:00:09.308
that he is planning to name
his nominee to replace

00:00:09.308 --> 00:00:11.711
retiring Supreme Court
Justice Stephen Breyer

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:12.912
by the end of next month

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:14.681
and then,
a day or two after that,

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:16.716
he'll nickname the nominee.

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:18.218
[ As Biden ]
Hey, Super Judge!

00:00:18.218 --> 00:00:19.318
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.318 --> 00:00:21.020
Judge-arino.
I'll get one. Don't worry.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.489
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:24.857
After White House
Press Secretary Jen Psaki

00:00:24.857 --> 00:00:26.493
said yesterday
that President Biden

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:27.894
will stand by his commitment

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:30.163
to appoint a Black woman
to the Supreme Court,

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:31.998
a Fox News panel criticized

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:33.766
the administration's
selection process.

00:00:33.766 --> 00:00:35.568
I'll take a wild guess and say

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:39.071
they have exactly two problems
with a Black woman.

00:00:39.071 --> 00:00:41.908
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:41.908 --> 00:00:45.244
The pharmaceutical company
Moderna announced yesterday

00:00:45.244 --> 00:00:46.679
that it has begun testing

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:49.682
its Omicron-specific
coronavirus vaccine.

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:52.985
Feels like that might be
outdated by the time it's ready.

00:00:52.985 --> 00:00:56.589
That's like hearing that Apple's
working on an iPhone 7.

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:59.259
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.259 --> 00:01:00.626
According to the latest numbers,

00:01:00.626 --> 00:01:04.564
the U.S. economy last quarter
grew by 6.9%.

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:05.532
"My pleasure!"

00:01:05.532 --> 00:01:06.966
said Spider-Man.

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:09.602
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:10.736
According to a new report,

00:01:10.736 --> 00:01:13.105
a witness told
federal prosecutors

00:01:13.105 --> 00:01:14.207
that he was present

00:01:14.207 --> 00:01:16.209
when Republican
Congressman Matt Gaetz

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:18.677
was told
that he had sex with a minor

00:01:18.677 --> 00:01:20.913
and he said you could've heard
a pin drop

00:01:20.913 --> 00:01:22.681
at that Homecoming dance.

00:01:22.681 --> 00:01:24.717
[ Laughter, ohs, and applause ]

00:01:30.556 --> 00:01:32.091
And almost in here.

00:01:32.091 --> 00:01:35.828
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.828 --> 00:01:38.597
In honor of the park's
30th anniversary

00:01:38.597 --> 00:01:40.500
and Women's History Month
in March,

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.502
Disneyland Paris
announced yesterday

00:01:42.502 --> 00:01:43.703
that Minnie Mouse will wear

00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:46.405
a dark blue-and-black
polka-dotted pantsuit

00:01:46.405 --> 00:01:47.840
designed by Stella McCartney.

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:50.442
Unfortunately, that still won't
make up for the fact

00:01:50.442 --> 00:01:52.011
that you brought your wife
to Paris

00:01:52.011 --> 00:01:53.612
and then took her to Disneyland.

00:01:53.612 --> 00:01:55.614
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:55.614 --> 00:01:57.249
"Hey, did you see the pantsuit?

00:01:57.249 --> 00:01:57.917
Uh-huh."

00:01:57.917 --> 00:01:59.986
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:02.722
A representative of the
anti-drug group D.A.R.E.

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:05.725
criticized the HBO show
"Euphoria" in a new interview

00:02:05.725 --> 00:02:09.162
and said it glorifies narcotics
use among high school students.

00:02:09.162 --> 00:02:12.198
But, realistically,
how many teens can afford

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:14.633
HBO and narcotics?

00:02:14.633 --> 00:02:18.203
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:18.203 --> 00:02:21.040
McDonald's is set to begin
selling a new item,

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:23.176
consisting
of a chicken sandwich,

00:02:23.176 --> 00:02:25.878
Big Mac, and Filet-O-Fish
all in one bun,

00:02:25.878 --> 00:02:29.248
called Land, Air &amp; Sea,
as opposed to its original name,

00:02:29.248 --> 00:02:30.883
Bathroom, Hospital, Cemetery.

00:02:30.883 --> 00:02:32.919
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:34.186 --> 00:02:36.456
[ Indistinct ]

00:02:36.456 --> 00:02:38.925
And, finally,
the Navy announced yesterday

00:02:38.925 --> 00:02:41.260
that it has discharged
45 sailors

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:43.729
for refusing to get
the coronavirus vaccine.

00:02:43.729 --> 00:02:45.465
Wow, I didn't realize the virus

00:02:45.465 --> 00:02:46.966
could be transmitted
through seamen.

00:02:46.966 --> 00:02:49.002
[ Laughter, ohs, and applause ]

00:02:50.903 --> 00:02:53.039
Discharged.

00:02:53.039 --> 00:02:54.273
Discharged seamen.

00:02:54.273 --> 00:02:58.144
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:58.144 --> 00:03:00.079
And that was the show
for the whole night?

00:03:00.079 --> 00:03:00.980
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:02.048
That was the monologue.

